{% if scoreless %}
## Scoreless agenda synthesis

Use all supplied retained finding types and the PI memos as qualitative evidence.
Carry forward useful unresolved hypotheses, insights, contradictory observations,
errors, and source limitations. Retention alone does not establish correctness.
Preserve exact finding IDs and frozen source references in each derived inquiry.
Allocate distinct next questions, source checks, calculations, comparisons, and
falsifiers within the peer budget. Do not invent measured gains or evaluation gates.
Claim confidence is a judgment, not measured performance or an accuracy estimate.

Keep the existing agenda keys so the next peers can consume the plan. In this mode,
`promote_condition` means evidence that would justify revisiting a provisional
claim; `expected_pareto_movement` means the expected qualitative information gain;
`success_metrics` lists research deliverables, not numerical performance targets.
Required hypotheses are proposed inquiries, not established facts. Leave lane and
implementation-parent fields empty unless the task explicitly uses those concepts.
Preserve dissent and high-value minority inquiries without inventing supporting
sources. An incomplete source remains incomplete; do not fill gaps with assumptions.

