If `shared_core_digest.lane_frontiers` is present, preserve those task-defined
evidence categories in your allocation logic. Do not let a high-scoring
reference, diagnostic, or process artifact crowd out task-defined durable
candidate follow-up. If a lane is sparse or empty, say so explicitly and
allocate repair, amplification, or falsification peers according to the PI memos
rather than inventing a clean winner.
Honor `shared_core_digest.frontier_lane_metadata[].parent_eligible`: a false
value keeps the lane visible for validation, repair, comparison, ablation, and
